licked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}]},"ic_folder_categories.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOComponents\/ic_folder_categories.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}